      "content_excerpt": "**Slack** — suggested above, click Connect to authenticate.\n\n**Groundcover** — not in Claude's connector registry, so it needs manual setup as a custom connector. Groundcover ships its own MCP server. To add it:\n\n1. Get your Groundcover MCP endpoint + API key from your Groundcover account (Settings → API keys, and the MCP/remote endpoint URL).\n2. In Claude Desktop: **Settings → Connectors → Add custom connector**.\n3. Enter the Groundcover MCP server URL and auth (API key / header) as provided by Groundcover.\n\nWant me to look up Groundcover's exact MCP endpoint and config format so you can paste it in?",
