      "content_excerpt": "Both **Slack** and **Groundcover** are now connected — their tools are live.\n\nOn `/plugin marketplace add cloudflare/skills`: that's a **Claude Code CLI** command, not something I can run here in the desktop Cowork app. The two environments manage plugins separately.\n\nTo add that marketplace you have two options:\n\n- **In Claude Code (terminal):** run `/plugin marketplace add cloudflare/skills` directly there, then `/plugin install <name>@cloudflare`.\n- **In Claude Desktop:** plugin marketplaces are managed through **Settings → Plugins** (or the plugin/marketplace UI), not via slash commands typed into chat.\n\nWhich environment are you trying to set this up in — the terminal (Claude Code) or the desktop app?",
